  "overview": "Rengoku is the premier damage dealer of Hinokami Chronicles 2. Flame Breathing emphasises high-damage individual hits and aggressive forward momentum—every Flame technique pushes him toward the opponent, making him naturally oppressive in close range. His Ninth Form (ultimate) deals the highest single-Ultimate damage in the game. Rengoku's weakness is range: his Skill Attacks have 2–5 frames slower startup than comparable Water Breathing moves, and he lacks a reliable mid-range poke. Optimal play keeps him in close range at all times.",
  "overviewJa": "煉獄はヒノカミ血風譚2における最高のダメージディーラー。炎の呼吸は高ダメージの個別ヒットと積極的な前進モメンタムを重視—全ての炎の技が相手に向かって前進させるため、近距離で自然に圧力をかける。玖ノ型（奥義）はゲームで最高の単発奥義ダメージを誇る。弱点はリーチ：技攻撃は水の呼吸の同等技より始動が2〜5フレーム遅く、信頼できる中距離ポークを持たない。最適プレイは常に近距離を維持すること。",
