      "note": "Respect his Hinokami Kagura Dance at close range. At the moment he activates Skill 3, jump backward to avoid the tracking hitbox. Re-engage when he lands with Unknowing Fire from the approach.",
      "noteJa": "近距離での神楽の舞を尊重する。技3発動の瞬間に後ろジャンプで追尾判定を回避。着地後に不知火アプローチで再接近。"
