      "vs": "Zenitsu",
      "note": "Zenitsu wins at close range with burst damage. Stay at mid-range (unusual for Rengoku) and use Blazing Universe to poke him out of Thunderclap approach. When he approaches, Rising Scorching Sun on his jumping variants.",
      "noteJa": "善逸はバーストダメージで近距離を制する。中距離を維持（煉獄には珍しい）し氾濫原で霹靂一閃アプローチをポーク。ジャンプアプローチには昇り炎天。"
